"Invite at least one additional user by specifying their full name "
"(autocompletion available)."
msgstr ""
"Pozvat nejméně jednoho dalšího uživatele zadáním jeho plného jména "
"(doplňování dostupné)."

#. TRANSLATOR: Group creation dialog, label
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:727 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:731 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:735
msgid "Username"
msgstr "Uživatelské jméno"

#. TRANSLATOR: Group creation dialog, title
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:744
msgid "Create group chat"
msgstr "Vytvořit skupinový chat"

#. TRANSLATOR: Group creation dialog, primary content
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:746
msgid "Invite users"
msgstr "Pozvat uživatele"

#. TRANSLATOR: Join error dialog, secondary content. all five arguments are URLs. "name" should be part of the URL, and indicate that it can be a name in your language.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:775
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"Invite link must start with {0}, {1} or {2}. Public group link must be {3}"
"name or {4}name."
msgstr ""
"Odkaz k pozvání musí začínat s {0}, {1} nebo {2}. Veřejný musí mít {3}jméno "
"nebo {4}jméno."

#. TRANSLATOR: Join error dialog, primary content
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:781
msgid "Must be invite link, public group link or group name"
msgstr "Musí být odkaz k pozvání, odkaz ke skupině nebo jméno"

#. TRANSLATOR: Join error dialog, primary content
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:800
msgid "Please enter group name and valid type"
msgstr "Prosím vložte jméno skupiny a platný typ"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account creation, telephone hint. Keep it short!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:961
msgid "phone no. (+ country prefix)"
msgstr "telefonní číslo. (+ s předvolbou země)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /cancel command.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1012
msgid "No message is being edited."
msgstr "Žádná zpráva se neupravuje."

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted picture's or video's placeholder, such as [Image#1], in the message being written.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1064
msgid "Send as a file"
msgstr "Odeslat jako soubor"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted video's placeholder by its file name, such as [holiday.mp4#2], in the message being written.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1067
msgid "Send as a video"
msgstr "Odeslat jako video"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted recording's placeholder by its file name, such as [note.ogg#3], in the message being written.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1070
msgid "Send as a voice message"
msgstr "Odeslat jako hlasovou zprávu"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted picture's placeholder by its file name, such as [holiday.jpg#1], in the message being written.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1073
msgid "Send as a photo"
msgstr "Odeslat jako fotografii"

#. TRANSLATOR: Item of the menu of a pasted thing's placeholder, such as [Image#1] or [report.pdf#3], in the message being written.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1076
msgid "Remove from the message"
msgstr "Odstranit ze zprávy"

#. TRANSLATOR: Error after the /paste command.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1101 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1118
msgid "There are no files or picture on the clipboard."
msgstr "Ve schránce nejsou žádné soubory ani obrázek."

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, of a picture or video pasted, in the list after "Pasted". The arguments are its placeholders, the second by a file name, such as [Image#1] and [holiday.jpg#1].
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1127
#, c++-format
msgid "{0} (or {1}, as a file)"
msgstr "{0} (nebo {1}, jako soubor)"

#. TRANSLATOR: In-chat notification, not logged, after /paste. The argument is the pasted things' placeholders, such as [Image#1] or [report.pdf].
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1131
#, c++-format
msgid "Pasted {}: write it into the message, where it goes, to send it there."
msgstr ""
"Vloženo {}: napište to do zprávy na místo, kam patří, a odešle se s ní."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, secondary content. Argument is the account's name, its phone number.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1274
#, c++-format
msgid "Account {} is not connected."
msgstr "Účet {} není připojen."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, primary content, after a file's link in a conversation was clicked.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1276
msgid "Cannot open the file"
msgstr "Soubor nelze otevřít"

#. TRANSLATOR: Information dialog, after a link to a message in a conversation was clicked. Primary content.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1319
msgid "The message is not shown"
msgstr "Zpráva není zobrazena"

#. TRANSLATOR: Information dialog, secondary content.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1321
msgid "It is no longer in this conversation's window."
msgstr "V okně této konverzace už není."

#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1581
msgid "No Telegram account is connected."
msgstr "Není připojen žádný účet Telegramu."

#. TRANSLATOR: Error dialog, secondary content. Argument is the account's name.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1583
#, c++-format
msgid "The Telegram account {} is not connected."
msgstr "Účet Telegramu {} není připojen."

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "kick <user>" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1610
msgid "kick <user>: Kick a user from the room using name or internal id"
msgstr ""
"kick <user>: Vykopnout uživatele z místnosti pomocí jména nebo interního ID"

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "hangup" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1616
msgid "hangup: Terminate any active call (with any user)"
msgstr "hangup: Ukončit jakékoliv aktivní volání (s kýmkoliv)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "cancel" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1622
msgid "cancel: Leave the message being edited as it was"
msgstr "cancel: Ponechat upravovanou zprávu beze změny"

#. TRANSLATOR: Command description, the initial "paste" must remain verbatim!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1628
msgid ""
"paste: Attach the files copied to the clipboard, or its picture, to the "
"message being written"
msgstr ""
"paste: Připojit ke psané zprávě soubory zkopírované do schránky, nebo její "
"obrázek"

#. TRANSLATOR: Tdlib crash dialog, secondary content. Argument is a filesystem path. Please keep the space after it!
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1648
#, c++-format
msgid ""
"The error may be caused by corrupt account data. If this is the case, it "
"could be fixed by removing account data under {} . You will be required to "
"log in into the account again."
msgstr ""
"Chyba může být způsobena poškozenými daty účtu. V tom případě, může být "
"opravena odstraněním dat z {} . Vyžaduje znovu přihlášení k účtu. "

#. TRANSLATOR: Tdlib crash dialog, title
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1658
msgid "Fatal error encountered in telegram plugin"
msgstr "Nastala fatální chyba v zásuvném modulu Telegram"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for file downloads (hyperlink link file:///tmp/asdf)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1775 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1780
msgid "Inline (hyperlinks in chat)"
msgstr "Vložené (odkaz v chatu)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for file downloads (file transfer dialog)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1777 ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1779
msgid "Standard file transfers"
msgstr "Standardní stahování souborů"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (choice)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1784
msgid "File downloads"
msgstr "Stahování souboru"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (choice)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1789
msgid "Inline auto-download size limit, MB (0 for unlimited)"
msgstr "Limit pro automatické stahování, MB (0 pro nekonečno)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for "Prefetch videos"; "the auto-download limit" is the option "Inline auto-download size limit".
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1798
msgid "Highest resolution within the auto-download limit (if one is set)"
msgstr ""
"Nejvyšší rozlišení v rámci limitu automatického stahování (je-li nastaven)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for "Prefetch videos": the highest resolution, or nothing if that is above the auto-download limit.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1801
msgid "Highest resolution only"
msgstr "Pouze nejvyšší rozlišení"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for "Prefetch videos"
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1803
msgid "Smallest file"
msgstr "Nejmenší soubor"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for "Prefetch videos"
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1805
msgid "Don't prefetch"
msgstr "Nestahovat předem"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (choice). Videos are downloaded beforehand, so that they play as soon as clicked.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1807
msgid "Prefetch videos"
msgstr "Stahovat videa předem"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for large file downloads
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1814
msgid "Ask"
msgstr "Zeptat se"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, value for large file downloads
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1816
msgid "Discard"
msgstr "Odmítnout"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, check box label
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1819
msgid "Do not clean up inline downloads"
msgstr "Nemazat soubory stažené do chatu"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (choice)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1825
msgid "Bigger inline file downloads"
msgstr "Stahování větších souborů"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean). The password is the one of the account's settings, not Telegram's two-step verification password.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1829
msgid ""
"Encrypt the local database with the password (takes effect at reconnect)"
msgstr "Šifrovat místní databázi heslem (projeví se po novém připojení)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1834
msgid "Enable secret chats (takes effect at reconnect)"
msgstr "Povolit tajné rozhovory (projeví se po novém připojení)"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1841
msgid "Show animated stickers"
msgstr "Zobrazit animované nálepky"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1847
msgid "Show self-destructing messages anyway"
msgstr "Přesto zobrazovat sebezničující zprávy"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1852
msgid "Strike out deleted messages in Pidgin, rather than remove them"
msgstr "Smazané zprávy v Pidginu přeškrtnout místo odstranění"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean)
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1857
msgid "Show messages from channels and groups you have not joined"
msgstr "Zobrazovat zprávy z kanálů a skupin, do kterých jste nevstoupili"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean). Of a file sent by file transfer ("Send File..."): told by its content, as a pasted one is; otherwise it goes as a file.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1863
msgid "Send a file as a picture, video or voice message when it is one"
msgstr "Odesílat soubor jako obrázek, video nebo hlasovou zprávu, pokud jím je"

#. TRANSLATOR: Account settings, key (boolean). Custom emoji are pictures of their own, each standing for an ordinary emoji.
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1869
msgid "Show custom emoji in reactions as ordinary emoji"
msgstr "Zobrazovat vlastní emoji v reakcích jako běžné emoji"

#. TRANSLATOR: 2FA settings, key
#: ../tdlib-purple.cpp:1890
msgid "Current password"
msgstr "Aktuální heslo"

